spoiler":false,"text":"\"Hayato was raised single-handedly by me! I will never let him go!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A petite mom with an interest in cosplay. Her true identity is the reincarnated goddess Alice, conceived with the soul of a demon god while still a virgin. Crafty and devious, she has a mother-in-law vibe, frequently indulging in physical contact due to excessive pampering of her son."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50024"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"コスプレが趣味の、ちびっこママ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は、処女の身で魔神の魂を受胎した＜再生の女神アイリス＞だったのだ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"計算高くて腹黒な姑で、息子が好き過ぎて過剰なスキンシップをしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"○リＢＢＡではなく、○リママァ。一緒におねんねする？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10608","sourceWorkId":"23978","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"コスプレが趣味の ちびっこママ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は、処女の身で魔神の魂を受胎した “再生の女神・アイリス”！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"計算高く腹黒な姑で、息子が好き過ぎて過剰なスキンシップをしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"○リBBAではなく、○リママァ。 一緒におねんねする？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「隼斗は妾が育てたのじゃ。 誰にも渡さぬぞ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43683"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/95cc4edd9fed6c7be6e1839ee2a0f09b68e3ae544ce4043dd2541ce92171431e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/988ca9efa6615452a51096ad33cadbbe19c4427f93b42ed316616d5405085bee.webp","width":125,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石原舞","creatorId":"vndb:s985","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s985","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s985","name":"石原 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:187083:43683:13372:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50025","characterName":"無花果 美命","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"43684","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"187083"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10609"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50025"},"originalCharacterName":"無花果 美命","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"This matter must be concluded! Let's get married!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hayato's classmate, a cheerful, candid, and energetic girl. Falling head over heels for Hayato due to an unexpected event. To affirm the sincerity of her feelings, she transforms into a carnivorous young lady who sweeps away rivals and forcefully pushes for her love."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50025"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隼斗のクラスメイトで、明るく素直でノリのいい女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は、ヤ○ザの跡取り娘だったのだ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょんなことから隼斗に一目惚れして、言い寄ってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸に抱く気持ちが本物か確かめるため、ライバルを蹴散らし、愛する者を押し倒す肉食系お嬢。わたし、脱ぐ前からすごいんです……！"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10609","sourceWorkId":"23978","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隼斗のクラスメイトで、明るく素直でノリの良い女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は、ヤ○ザの跡取り娘！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょんなことから隼斗に一目惚れして、言い寄ってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸に抱く気持ちが本物か確かめるためライバルを蹴散らし、愛する者を押し倒す肉食系お嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"わたし、脱ぐ前からすごいんです……！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「これはケジメ案件ですね。 結婚しましょう！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43684"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/485212d78a793f8ff30f5edde0fee16e48c56a5cf45206b762bc1727ddf0617a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/47ef6cda2168fa2d92c3f9d7b4725eaf9fcf16869b444aa8d317c20883652d57.webp","width":91,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡嶋妙","creatorId":"vndb:s359","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s359","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s359","name":"岡嶋 妙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:187083:43684:4646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50027","characterName":"秤 真理","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"43685","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"187083"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10610"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50027"},"originalCharacterName":"秤 真理","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Leave the troublesome to me, the class president~\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A bossy class president who works at a family restaurant after school. Though she strives to become a perfect lady, she is actually clumsy and always causing trouble. After awakening an ability due to a certain incident, she can visualize the \"weight of sin\" in others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50027"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美命の親友。男勝りな口調が特徴のクラス委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ファミレスでバイトをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鬼真面目でお節介焼きな性格で、転校生である隼斗の面倒を見てくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"立派な乙女であろうと努めるが、実はへっぽこでポンコツなため失敗続きなのだ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある事件がきっかけで、相手の＜罪の重さ＞を視覚化できるようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10610","sourceWorkId":"23978","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美命の親友。 男勝りな口調が特徴のクラス委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鬼真面目でお節介焼きな性格をしていて、転校生である隼斗の面倒を見てくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ファミレスでアルバイトもしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"立派な乙女であろうと努めるが、実はへっぽこでポンコツなため失敗続き！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある事件がきっかけで、相手の “罪の重さ” を視覚化できるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「厄介事は委員長に任せろ♪　……って、きゃあ!?」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43685"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0ed2f1b0d683dd0e872733f0f732b95c0e46e4ca23667921f9f8ad14e67462e0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e77ca768cc962d72e9552e874eff694617ecb2e4333869ee9ca400a270d7c349.webp","width":140,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小野涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s367","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s367","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s367","name":"小野 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:187083:43685:4727:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50029","characterName":"リコ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"43686","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"187083"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10611"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50029"},"originalCharacterName":"リコ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Let Riko help you release the magic!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The mysterious dog-eared girl who attacks Hayato. Actually a \"Goddess Substitute\". She enjoys mischief and speaks ambiguously manipulating Hayato effortlessly. Having a unique fondness for scents, she likes to 'sniff' bandages that have absorbed Hayato's magic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50029"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隼斗に襲いかかってくる謎の犬耳少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は、神界から遣わされた＜女神候補＞だったのだ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"警戒心が強いが、慣れれば尻尾を振って甘えまくる『わんだふる』ガール。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪戯好きで思わせぶりな言動が多く、隼斗を翻弄しまくる。匂いフェチで、隼斗の魔力を吸収した包帯で『ハスハス』するのが趣味。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10611","sourceWorkId":"23978","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隼斗に襲いかかってくる謎の犬耳少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は、神界から遣わされた “女神候補”！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"警戒心が強いが、慣れれば尻尾を振って甘えまくる“わんだふる”ガール。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いたずら好きで思わせぶりな言動が多く、隼斗を翻弄しまくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"匂いフェチで、隼斗の魔力を吸収した包帯で“ハスハス”するのが趣味。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「リコがおじさんの魔力を“ぴゅっぴゅっ”してあげるね♪」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43686"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d8ec90ec0383ff1f1fdb868de7e2c6f04981e79fb64e7545c69a8f04353aca12.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d074982becc5c52d585a38784bde7cc5154821ab37d622f0e40823c6ba540c0.webp","width":140,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さいとうよしえ","creatorId":"vndb:s1545","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1545","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1545","name":"さいとう よしえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:187083:43686:20696:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c54805","characterName":"鳴川 隼斗","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"58206","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"187083"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10607"],"vndbCharacterId":"c54805"},"originalCharacterName":"鳴川 隼斗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hayato is the reincarnation of a powerful devil and a son of Goddess Iris, thus he is able to wield both Divine and Demonic magic."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54805"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"季節外れの転校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は、＜怒りの魔神アンゴルモア＞の転生体だったのだ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生真面目で不器用な性格。色恋沙汰が苦手だが、なぜか周りが放っておかない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神界に戻るため善行を積んでいるが、柄の悪い風体のため誤解を受けやすい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacte